@There are some freebie hints on those signs over there you can look at if you'd like.[13][02]

[06 63 04 47 DE F3 00]@Oh me?
@I'm just practicing wrapping presents.
@You can go ahead and open them. 
@Then I'll be able to practice even more![13][02]

@Lately I've been playing this new game called
  <EarthBound Beginnings>.
@It's difficult, but the challenge makes it fun![13][02]

@Don't give me that garbage.
