[02]

@I once saw smoke rising from one of the islands off the coast.
@I wonder if anyone lives there.
@I wish I had looked through that telescope...[13][02]

@I heard there's a Super NES game called <EarthBound Beginnings>.
@I don't exactly know what that means, but it doesn't matter.
@If you shouldn't judge a book by its cover,[10 0F] then don't judge a game by its title.[13][02]

@Have you played Super Mario Bros. 7?
@I'm still stuck on the third one.
@It's really tough![13][02]

@La-la-laaa...
@Into the wide blue sky...
  dandelion fuzz does fly...
@La-la-laaa!
@I love music more than anything else![13][02]

@The curfew has finally been lifted.
@There's a strange rock-like thing in a mountain cave past here.
@It's so strange,[10 0F] you should definitely take a look.[13][02]

@The curfew has been lifted.
@Although I can't see why travel was ever restricted.[19 10 01][0B 01][1B 02 19 0F F6 00]
